890:  * @param[in] This          handle of the ktxTexture to upload.
891:  * @param[in,out] pTexture  name of the GL texture object to load. If NULL or if
892:  *                          <tt>*pTexture == 0</tt> the function will generate
893:  *                          a texture name. The function binds either the
894:  *                          generated name or the name given in @p *pTexture
895:  *                          to the texture target returned in @p *pTarget,
896:  *                          before loading the texture data. If @p pTexture
897:  *                          is not NULL and a name was generated, the generated
898:  *                          name will be returned in *pTexture.
899:  * @param[out] pTarget      @p *pTarget is set to the texture target used. The
